v2rayA NextGen packaging
========================

The OpenWrt packages built by this repository contain binaries compiled from
the upstream v2rayA project:

    https://github.com/v2rayA/v2rayA

  * v2raya (the service and web UI) is licensed AGPL-3.0-only.
  * v2raya_core is licensed MPL-2.0.

The corresponding source is the tagged upstream release pinned in
v2raya/Makefile and v2raya-core/Makefile, plus the patches and build files in
this repository:

  * https://github.com/AmrFateem/luci-V2raya-NextGen
  * v2raya/patches/
  * THIRD-PARTY.md

The package Makefiles document the exact build (Go modules, build tags and
ldflags) needed to reproduce the binaries. Full license texts are in
LICENSES/.

Packaging, init scripts, and CI in this repository are GPL-3.0-only.
LuCI application code is Apache-2.0; see
luci-app-v2raya-nextgen/LICENSE. The top-level LICENSE covers the packaging.

GeoIP data is from https://github.com/v2fly/geoip (CC-BY-SA-4.0).
GeoSite data is from https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community (MIT).

This is an independent, AI-assisted packaging project. It is not an official
v2rayA release and is not affiliated with the v2rayA authors.
